          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Grounding, anxiety, blood pressure</p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-sm text-forest-600 dark:text-forest-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0">Learn More →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/points/lv3-taichong-acupressure-point/" class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-forest-400 hover:shadow-sm dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-forest-600">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-forest-100 dark:bg-forest-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-forest-700 dark:text-forest-300 text-sm font-bold">LV3</div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">LV3 (Taichong)<span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 font-normal"> · Great Surge</span></h3>
          <div class="text-yellow-500 text-xs mt-0.5">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Stress, headaches, menstrual health</p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-sm text-forest-600 dark:text-forest-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0">Learn More →</span>
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-forest-100 dark:bg-forest-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-forest-700 dark:text-forest-300 text-sm font-bold">GB39</div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">GB39 (Xuanzhong)<span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 font-normal"> · Suspended Bell</span></h3>
          <div class="text-yellow-500 text-xs mt-0.5">★★★☆</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Leg pain, ankle pain, neck stiffness</p>
        </div>
</div>
      <a href="/points/bl60-kunlun-acupressure-point/" class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-forest-400 hover:shadow-sm dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-forest-600">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-forest-100 dark:bg-forest-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-forest-700 dark:text-forest-300 text-sm font-bold">BL60</div>
